## chart main Project Status Crux
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  vision["Vision promise"]
  green["GREEN Working/proof-backed"]
  yellow["YELLOW Gap has Bead coverage"]
  red["RED No Bead/unimplemented"]
  flow["Open primary flows"]
  epic["Open epic status"]
  proof["Open proof gaps"]
  drift["Open docs drift"]
  next["Next move"]
  vision --> green
  vision --> yellow
  vision --> red
  green --> flow
  yellow --> epic
  red --> proof
  red --> drift
  proof --> next
  drift --> next
  class green green
  class yellow yellow
  class red red
  class flow,epic,proof,drift,next gray
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef red fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#c53030,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0505
  classDef gray fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1px,color:#111827
```

## chart epic-gantt Epic Status
```mermaid
gantt
  title Epic Status
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  section GREEN Working
  GREEN Evidence-backed slice :done, 2026-05-01, 1d
  section YELLOW Bead-covered gaps
  YELLOW Reality-check gap has Bead :active, 2026-05-02, 2d
  section RED No Bead
  RED Create missing Bead first :crit, 2026-05-04, 1d
```

## chart epic-map Epic Map
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  core["GREEN Core promise works"]
  covered["YELLOW Adjacent gap covered by Bead"]
  missing["RED Vision gap has no Bead"]
  future["GRAY Future or unknown"]
  core --> covered
  covered --> missing
  covered --> future
  class core green
  class covered yellow
  class missing red
  class future gray
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef red fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#c53030,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0505
  classDef gray fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1px,color:#111827
```

## chart primary-flows Primary Flows
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  operator["Operator"]
  request["Request / trigger"]
  runtime["GREEN Runtime path works"]
  review["YELLOW Review gap covered by Bead"]
  output["RED Output gap has no Bead"]
  operator --> request --> runtime --> review --> output
  class operator,request gray
  class runtime green
  class review yellow
  class output red
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef red fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#c53030,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0505
  classDef gray fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1px,color:#111827
```

## chart lifecycle Main Lifecycle
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Requested
  Requested --> Running
  Running --> NeedsReview
  NeedsReview --> Delivered
  Running --> Blocked
  Blocked --> Running
  Delivered --> [*]
  note right of Delivered
    GREEN: delivered path is working/proof-backed
  end note
  note right of NeedsReview
    YELLOW: review gap has Bead coverage
  end note
  note right of Blocked
    RED: blocker has no Bead yet
  end note
```

## chart architecture-boundary Architecture Boundary
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph ProjectRepo["Project repo"]
    routes["Routes / CLI"]
    domain["Domain logic"]
    proof["Tests / proof"]
  end
  subgraph SharedInfra["Shared infrastructure"]
    auth["Auth / policy"]
    connectors["Connectors"]
  end
  routes --> domain --> proof
  domain --> connectors
  auth --> routes
  green["GREEN Owned path works"]
  yellow["YELLOW Shared gap has Bead"]
  red["RED Boundary gap has no Bead"]
  proof --> green
  connectors --> yellow
  auth --> red
  class routes,domain,proof,green green
  class connectors,yellow yellow
  class auth,red red
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef red fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#c53030,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0505
```

## chart proof-status Proof Status
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  passed["GREEN Checks/proof passed"]
  covered["YELLOW Missing proof covered by Bead"]
  unrun["RED Missing proof has no Bead"]
  caveat["RED Claim drift has no Bead"]
  passed --> covered
  covered --> unrun
  covered --> caveat
  class passed green
  class covered yellow
  class unrun,caveat red
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef red fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#c53030,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0505
```

## chart drift Docs Code Beads Drift
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  docs["Docs promise"]
  code["GREEN Code proof matches promise"]
  beads["YELLOW Open Beads cover drift"]
  release["Released / deployed state"]
  docs --> code
  code --> beads
  code --> release
  drift["RED Drift has no Bead coverage"]
  docs --> drift
  beads --> drift
  release --> drift
  class docs,release gray
  class code green
  class beads yellow
  class drift red
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef red fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#c53030,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0505
  classDef gray fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1px,color:#111827
```

## chart next-move Next Move
```mermaid
flowchart LR
  finding["RED Highest-leverage no-Bead finding"]
  action["YELLOW Create/claim Bead to address it"]
  proof["GREEN Proof command after fix"]
  finding --> action --> proof
  class finding red
  class action yellow
  class proof green
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef red fill:#ffd6d6,stroke:#c53030,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a0505
```
